    "detailed_description": "<h1>\ud83d\ude80 Early Access Now Live!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LocalHelper.AI is still growing \u2014 and your feedback matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help shape the future by suggesting or voting on new features on our forum!</p></p><br><h1>About the Software</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udde0 About This Application</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LocalHelper.ai</strong> is your private, voice-enabled AI assistant for home and office \u2014 running entirely on your own computer, without sending anything to the cloud.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It helps you stay productive, get quick answers, control your devices (coming soon), and manage everyday tasks \u2014 all through natural voice or text interaction. You stay in control: your data never leaves your PC.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\ude80 Early Access</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LocalHelper is currently in <strong>Early Access</strong>, and some features are still limited. The core experience is fully functional, but we're actively expanding capabilities based on user feedback.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can help shape the future of LocalHelper by suggesting or voting on new features on our forum or directly from the program menu!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2728 Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udde3\ufe0f Talk or type \u2014 your assistant listens and responds naturally</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd12 100% offline operation \u2014 your data stays private</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 Helps with daily tasks: answers, summaries, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca1 Continuously evolving with community-driven updates</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcce Lightweight and easy to run \u2014 no subscriptions or accounts required</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LocalHelper is ideal for privacy-conscious users, remote workers, or anyone who wants an AI assistant without giving up control of their personal data.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udde0 About This Application</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LocalHelper.ai</strong> is your private, voice-enabled AI assistant for home and office \u2014 running entirely on your own computer, without sending anything to the cloud.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It helps you stay productive, get quick answers, control your devices (coming soon), and manage everyday tasks \u2014 all through natural voice or text interaction. You stay in control: your data never leaves your PC.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\ude80 Early Access</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LocalHelper is currently in <strong>Early Access</strong>, and some features are still limited. The core experience is fully functional, but we're actively expanding capabilities based on user feedback.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can help shape the future of LocalHelper by suggesting or voting on new features on our forum or directly from the program menu!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2728 Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udde3\ufe0f Talk or type \u2014 your assistant listens and responds naturally</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd12 100% offline operation \u2014 your data stays private</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 Helps with daily tasks: answers, summaries, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca1 Continuously evolving with community-driven updates</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcce Lightweight and easy to run \u2014 no subscriptions or accounts required</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LocalHelper is ideal for privacy-conscious users, remote workers, or anyone who wants an AI assistant without giving up control of their personal data.</p>",
    "short_description": "\ud83e\udde0 Your private AI assistant \u2014 control your PC with voice or text, manage tasks, and boost productivity. \ud83d\udd12 100% offline \u2014 no internet, no accounts, no tracking. \ud83d\ude80 In Early Access \u2014 suggest features and shape the future of LocalHelper on our forum!",
