        "minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-10400 / AMD Ryzen 5 3600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA 30xx GPU with 8 GB VRAM with latest drivers<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 12 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Any standard audio device; USB or built-in audio interface<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Microphone with good sensitivity and clarity required</li></ul>",
        "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-12700 / AMD Ryzen 7 5800X or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 32 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA RTX 4060 or better (8 GB+ VRAM recommended)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 12 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> High-quality onboard audio or dedicated USB audio interface<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Use of high-quality condenser microphone and quiet environment strongly improves voice interaction</li></ul>"
